<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Wiring to issue 7 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Wiring to issue 7 bln yen CB.</headline>
<text>
<p>TOKYO, Aug 26 (Reuter)</p>
<p> BORROWER - Sumitomo Wiring Systems Ltd</p>
<p> LEAD MGR - Daiwa Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p> TRUSTEE - Sumitomo Trust Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible	    ISSUE NO   1    AMT   7 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON 0.85%(tentatively) ISS PRICE	 MATURITY 30.Sep.08</p>
<p> CONV PRICE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 1.Oct.96   CONV TO 29.Sep.08</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 11.Sep.96  INT PAY end Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 3.Sep-10.Sep</p>
<p> LAST JCR   A-	  LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on September 2.</p>
</text>
